    "subject": "Confirm your subscription to Cencori Status",
    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark\" />\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"dark\" />\n  <title>Subscription confirmation · OutRay</title>\n  <style>\n    @font-face { font-family: 'Geom'; src: url('http://localhost:6767/fonts/geom-latin.woff2') format('woff2'); font-style: normal; font-weight: 300 900; font-display: swap; }\n    html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #080808; }\n    body, table, td, a, h1, p { font-family: 'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; }\n    body { -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n    table { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; }\n    a { text-decoration: none; }\n    .confirm:hover { background: #dedee2 !important; }\n    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #a78bfa; outline-offset: 5px; }\n    @media (max-width: 600px) {\n      .page { padding: 36px 20px 40px !important; }\n      .brand { padding: 0 4px 28px !important; }\n      .content { padding: 32px 28px 30px !important; }\n      .heading { font-size: 32px !important; }\n      .footer { padding: 26px 8px 0 !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n  <!--[if mso]><style>body, table, td, a, h1, p { font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; }</style><![endif]-->\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#080808;color:#f7f7f8;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;\">Confirm your email to receive incident updates from Cencori Status.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#080808\" style=\"width:100%;background:#080808;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"page\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:64px 24px 56px;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n        <!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"544\" align=\"center\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"544\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:544px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"brand\" style=\"padding:0 4px 32px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"32\" style=\"width:32px;vertical-align:middle;\"><img src=\"http://localhost:6767/logo.png\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:31px;height:31px;border:0;\" /></td>\n                  <td style=\"padding-left:10px;vertical-align:middle;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:23px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.9px;color:#f7f7f8;\">OutRay</td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td bgcolor=\"#101012\" style=\"background:#101012;border:1px solid #29292d;border-radius:20px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"content\" style=\"padding:40px 40px 36px;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:29px;\">\n                      <tr><td style=\"padding:7px 11px;background:#1b1724;border:1px solid #352b46;border-radius:7px;color:#c2adee;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:550;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Cencori Status</td></tr>\n                    </table>\n                    <h1 class=\"heading\" style=\"margin:0;color:#f7f7f8;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:36px;line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-1.4px;font-weight:600;\">Confirm your<br />subscription.</h1>\n                    <p style=\"margin:21px 0 0;color:#aaaab3;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:400;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">One last step. Confirm your email to receive incident updates published by Cencori Status.</p>\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:30px;\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#f7f7f8\" style=\"background:#f7f7f8;border-radius:10px;mso-padding-alt:14px 20px;\">\n                          <a class=\"confirm\" href=\"https://status.example.test/confirm?token=preview-only\" style=\"display:block;padding:14px 20px;background:#f7f7f8;border:1px solid #f7f7f8;border-radius:10px;color:#101012;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.15px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;\">Confirm subscription&nbsp;&nbsp; <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                    <p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;text-align:center;color:#85858f;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;\">This link expires in 24 hours.</p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"footer\" style=\"padding:27px 16px 0;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0;color:#85858f;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;\">Didn’t request this? You can ignore this email.<br />You won’t be subscribed unless you confirm.</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:22px 0 0;color:#7d7d87;font-family:'Geom', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;\">Status updates, delivered by <a href=\"https://outray.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#aaaab3;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;\">OutRay</a>.</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n        <!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
